  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "The All Seasons Collection 30A is proud to include this newly remodeled family getaway in our portfolio of distinctive homes all located in the town of Rosemary Beach. This home has been completely refurbished to include a total remodel to include all living/kitchen space.. As one of the largest outdoor pool/courtyard area's in Rosemary it has been totally transformed. The outdoor dining deck with natural gas grill and comfortable seating is the perfect place to relax. Around the pool are several options for lounging and entertaining. New furniture, carpeting and soft cool new paint colors enhance this downstairs open floor plan that includes: kitchen, dining and living space, the flow makes this the perfect retreat to celebrate and vacation in true Rosemary style while enjoying 3300 sq.ft. of comfort and relaxation. The double French doors flow onto the outside veranda and spacious newly redesigned courtyard/pool area that includes a 20 X 12 ft. heated pool.<br>Also located on the first floor is a king bedded master suite with double vanity sinks, larger soaking tub tub and expansive walk-in glass tiled shower. An additional full bath as well as a separate indoor shower area that can be accessed from the pool is another great feature along with the over sized laundry room. <br><br>Located on the second floor is another king bedroom with ensuite, double vanity sinks and an outdoor balcony overlooking the courtyard and pool area. The third bedroom a king also on this floor connects to a full bath, Shower tub combination with double vanity sinks that is shared with the 4 bedded bunk room, all include TV's.<br><br>The third level perfect for the younger generation is expansive, with one set of bunks three twin beds and and one queen. A full bath with walk-in shower are also on this level along with TV, Blue-ray DVD and many board games.<br><br>This home has every amenity to enhance your visit. Other great features include the two car private parking area and close to the town center and beach to name a few. Please let us know if you have any questions and we will look forward to welcoming you and your family on your first or return visit to Rosemary.<br>There is a seasonal fee of $400 per week to heat the pool. Kindly understand this home is not available for weddings.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "PRIVATE BEACH ACCESS-Stunning Remodel-Private Pool-4 Bikes"
        }
      ],
